Related first-party packages (separate repositories)

  PoseBust — standalone C++26 pose validation (NativePoseQC + optional
  upstream PoseBusters CLI bridge). Same copyright holders; Apache-2.0.
  https://github.com/LeBonhommePharma/PoseBust

  FlexAIDdS retains an in-tree copy under LIB/PoseBust (namespace
  flexaids::posebust) for DatasetRunner and benchmark integration. The
  standalone PoseBust repo is the independent packaging surface
  (namespace posebust).

